Trovitopolis_Text_1:
	.string "Pfew…\n"
	.string "I finally reached TROVITOPOLIS.\p"
	.string "It’s a rough road crossing\n"
	.string "MANDARIN DESERT.$"

Trovitopolis_Text_2:
	.string "TROVITOPOLIS is one of the largest\n"
	.string "cities in the ORANGE ARCHIPELAGO.\p"
	.string "The TROVITO DEPT. STORE is one of\n"
	.string "our main attractions.$"

Trovitopolis_Text_3:
	.string "I haven’t decided who I’m going to\n"
	.string "vote for yet.\p"
	.string "Our current MAYOR has some weird\n"
	.string "policies on sewer management.$"

Trovitopolis_Text_4:
	.string "You want to go to TROVITA ISLAND?\p"
	.string "You should go west from here and\n"
	.string "you’ll reach ROUTE O.\p"
	.string "From there it’s just a small\n"
	.string "distance to TROVITA ISLAND.$"

Trovitopolis_Text_5:
	.string "TROVITOPOLIS \n"
	.string "The Big City$"

Trovitopolis_Text_6:
	.string "TROVITOPOLIS MAYOR’s OFFICE$"

Trovitopolis_Text_7:
	.string "It’s a notice.\p"
	.string "Look out for wandering POKéMON\n"
	.string "when going into the SEWERS.$"
